── What this repository contains ──

This repository contains the MCP server manifest (server.json), documentation,
response examples, and a stdio bridge (bridge.py, Dockerfile) for Den. It does
not include the Den knowledge graph, the serving code, or any standards text
corpus. Those are not published here.

The manifest points at a hosted endpoint (https://mcp.den.archi/mcp) that
requires authorization. Copying this repository does not grant access to it.

